        "TileImage": "$($repository e8acedeb-71f0-43c7-adf6-50c28325579a).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rThe Syndicate has infiltrated The Ark Society on the Isle of Sgail, occupying the top floor with a council of members. Hosted by Chairwoman Zoe Washington and Sophia Washington, The Ark Society is a survivalist group for the global elite, preparing for civilization’s collapse. Your targets—Roman Zelenko, Catherine “Kiki” Zola, Godfrey Hagen, Bernadette Craig—are split across two floors. Remove them to weaken Syndicate control.\r\rHappy hunting, 47.",
